# Ignore everything by default. This repository publishes only
# the Blendshape Editor VPM package.
# (Assets/ のアバターデータ、BlendshapeEditor_Release/ のライセンスインストーラー、
#  Assets/BlendshapeEditorDev/ の書き出しメニューは、ここで除外される)
/*

# Keep this ignore policy and repository documentation.
!/.gitignore
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/README.md
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/release.yml

# Keep only the VPM package.
!/Packages/
/Packages/*
!/Packages/com.azipaworks.blendshape-editor/
!/Packages/com.azipaworks.blendshape-editor/**
